* surgery.treatNone -> "StrokeCareProcess：Observation.valueBoolean" "code = stroke-observation#no-surgery；有勾選填 true；未勾選不建立。"
* surgery.treatCraniectomy -> "StrokeProcedure：Procedure.status" "code.coding:strokeProcedure 填 http://vgh-stroke-ig.fhir.tw/CodeSystem/stroke-procedure#decompressive-craniectomy，並加填 SNOMED CT 1288015005（code.coding:sct-procedures）。1→completed、0→not-done；空白不建立。"
* surgery.treatHematomaEvacuation -> "StrokeProcedure：Procedure.status" "code.coding:strokeProcedure 填 http://vgh-stroke-ig.fhir.tw/CodeSystem/stroke-procedure#hematoma-evacuation。1→completed、0→not-done；空白不建立。"
* surgery.treatEvd -> "StrokeProcedure：Procedure.status" "code.coding:strokeProcedure 填 http://vgh-stroke-ig.fhir.tw/CodeSystem/stroke-procedure#external-ventricular-drainage，並加填 SNOMED CT 230869001（code.coding:sct-procedures）。1→completed、0→not-done；空白不建立。"
* surgery.treatVpShunt -> "StrokeProcedure：Procedure.status" "code.coding:strokeProcedure 填 http://vgh-stroke-ig.fhir.tw/CodeSystem/stroke-procedure#ventriculoperitoneal-shunt，並加填 SNOMED CT 47020004（code.coding:sct-procedures）。1→completed、0→not-done；空白不建立。"
* surgery.treatOther -> "StrokeProcedure：Procedure.status" "code.coding:strokeProcedure 填 http://vgh-stroke-ig.fhir.tw/CodeSystem/stroke-procedure#other-surgery。1→completed、0→not-done；空白不建立。"
* surgery.treatOtherName -> "StrokeProcedure：Procedure.code.text" "與其他手術治療註記（code = http://vgh-stroke-ig.fhir.tw/CodeSystem/stroke-procedure#other-surgery）合併為同一筆，名稱只填 code.text。勾選 1 時才建立。"
* complication.complicationNone -> "StrokeComplication：Observation.valueBoolean" "code = stroke-observation#no-complication；勾選→true，未勾選不建立。"
* complication.complicationPneumonia -> "StrokeComplication：Observation.valueBoolean" "code = stroke-observation#complication-pneumonia；0→false、1→true，空白不建立；其他代碼以原值存入 StrokeRegistryResponse。"
* complication.complicationSepsis -> "StrokeComplication：Observation.valueBoolean" "code = stroke-observation#complication-sepsis；0→false、1→true，空白不建立；其他代碼以原值存入 StrokeRegistryResponse。"
* complication.complicationUti -> "StrokeComplication：Observation.valueBoolean" "code = stroke-observation#complication-urinary-tract-infection；0→false、1→true，空白不建立；其他代碼以原值存入 StrokeRegistryResponse。"
* complication.complicationAcs -> "StrokeComplication：Observation.valueBoolean" "code = stroke-observation#complication-acute-coronary-syndrome；0→false、1→true，空白不建立；其他代碼以原值存入 StrokeRegistryResponse。"
* complication.complicationUgi -> "StrokeComplication：Observation.valueBoolean" "code = stroke-observation#complication-upper-gi-bleeding；0→false、1→true，空白不建立；其他代碼以原值存入 StrokeRegistryResponse。"
* complication.complicationSeizure -> "StrokeComplication：Observation.valueBoolean" "code = stroke-observation#complication-seizure；0→false、1→true，空白不建立；其他代碼以原值存入 StrokeRegistryResponse。"
* complication.complicationRf -> "StrokeComplication：Observation.valueBoolean" "code = stroke-observation#complication-renal-failure；0→false、1→true，空白不建立；其他代碼以原值存入 StrokeRegistryResponse。"
* complication.complicationDvt -> "StrokeComplication：Observation.valueBoolean" "code = stroke-observation#complication-deep-vein-thrombosis；0→false、1→true，空白不建立；其他代碼以原值存入 StrokeRegistryResponse。"
* complication.complicationEvolution -> "StrokeComplication：Observation.valueBoolean" "code = stroke-observation#neurologic-deterioration-nihss-2-or-more | stroke-observation#neurologic-deterioration-criteria-unspecified；code 用 neurologic-deterioration-criteria-unspecified。0 填 false、1 填 true，空白不建立。"
* complication.complicationOther -> "StrokeComplication：Observation.valueBoolean" "code = stroke-observation#complication-other；0→false、1→true，空白不建立；其他代碼以原值存入 StrokeRegistryResponse。"
* complication.complicationOtherName -> "StrokeComplication：Observation.valueString" "code = stroke-observation#complication-other-name；照原樣保留來源文字。"
* nihssAdmission.nihssHospitalizationDate -> "StrokeNIHSS：Observation.effectiveDateTime" "code = http://loinc.org#72089-6；assessmentPhase=admission。日期與同次評估時間合併填入 effectiveDateTime。時區確認前只填日期（YYYY-MM-DD），時間原值以 StrokeEventTimeOnly 擴充附在該元素上，並存入 StrokeRegistryResponse 的原始值題目；確認後填完整日期時間與時區（例如 +08:00）。若只有年月或只有時間就不填，原值存 StrokeRegistryResponse。"
