* targetVessel.targetPcaL -> "StrokeEvtProcedureDetail：Observation.valueBoolean" "code = stroke-observation#target-vessel-pca-left；0→false、1→true，空白不建立；其他代碼以原值存入 StrokeRegistryResponse。"
